    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sȳcămīnus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-os</span></b> , i, f.,
