		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
			mulberry-tree</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 3, 18 <i>med.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 18,
